  "limitations": [
    "English explicit labels only; unlabelled values, unknown-language labels, incomplete or fragmented values, cross-turn values and oversized unsupported shapes are outside the boundary.",
    "Numeric secret spans are at most 256 characters including separators; password tokens/quoted phrases at most 128 characters. No PAN, bank-account validity or caller ownership inference.",
